WebGradients collection — licensing
===================================

webgradients.go holds 175 of the 180 gradients of WebGradients (https://github.com/itmeo/webgradients,
https://webgradients.com), built into every Kitwork UI site: the top layer of each, its colours and the
places of its stops as the collection's stylesheet, webgradients.css, writes them (read 13/10/2026 at
commit 0157829a0069756083abd3bfa81bef7117e14dfd, sha256
472b0f48569a9fbbbbd7d84e75fa859a5add3e0a5be82953c1e12e7434ff1349), each angle rounded to the nearest
of eight directions and twelve of them under another name (webGradientRenames in webgradients.go). Four
are drawn short of the stylesheet, and five, layers one gradient cannot draw, are left out
(webgradients_gen.go says which). webgradients_source_test.go keeps the stylesheet's blocks as
published, for the tests. Both are redistributed under the collection's MIT License, copied below
exactly as its LICENSE file states it.

